            <div xml:id="d476">

                <pb facs="0759" n="655" sameAs="frus:frus1933v02/pg655"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">653.116/125: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Portugal
                        (Caldwell)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1933-11-08T20:00:00-05:00">November 8, 1933—8
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>12. Your despatch 68, October 23. Since it is expected that commercial treaty
                    discussions will be started in a day or so with the Portuguese Minister, I feel
                    that it will be better to delay for the time being the representations you
                    suggest making.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
